  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, add gnocchi and fry, tossing occasionally, until golden, 6-8 minutes. Season. Transfer gnocchi to a bowl and cover to keep warm. TIP: Add more olive oil if the gnocchi sticks to the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66cd78634ac430fcc0016f10-e97c3c26.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While gnocchi is cooking, trim green beans and cut into thirds.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66cd78634ac430fcc0016f10-ea878118.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook green beans and snacking tomatoes, tossing, until tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add garlic paste and savoury seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in baby spinach leaves, cooked gnocchi, thickened cream, the water and butter. Cook, stirring, until slightly thickened and wilted, 3-4 minutes. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66cd78634ac430fcc0016f10-0d71e21e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide one-pan creamy veggie gnocchi between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over Parmesan cheese and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66cd78634ac430fcc0016f10-4c2cb405.jpeg"
    }
  ]
